stant colors<\/li><li>Longer lifespan<\/li><li>Better traction surface<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Maintenance:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Simple soap and water cleaning<\/li><li>No annual treatments required<\/li><li>Virtually maintenance-free<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Warranty:<\/strong> 25 years on decking<\/p>","right_button_text":"Shop Composite Deck Kit","right_button_class":"button-secondary","right_button_link":"https:\/\/a-diy.com\/products\/a-diy-composite-deck-kit","background_color":"#ece8e4"}},"center_heading_media_with_text_ciQxp8":{"type":"center-heading-media-with-text","name":"Center Heading with Two Column","settings":{"heading":"Floating Deck Ideas for Every Backyard","first_richtext":"<h3><strong>Backyard Retreat<\/strong><\/h3><p>Create a peaceful escape in a corner of your yard. Perfect for morning coffee, reading, or meditation away from the house.<\/p><p><\/p><p><\/p><h3><strong>Pool Deck<\/strong><\/h3><p>Add safe, slip-resistant deck space around your above-ground pool or as a sunbathing area nearby.<\/p><p><\/p><h3><strong>Entertaining Hub<\/strong><\/h3><p>Build your new outdoor dining and BBQ space. Large enough for furniture, grill, and guests.<\/p><p><\/p><h3><strong>Under-Tree Oasis<\/strong><\/h3><p>Use a floating deck to create a shaded seating area under mature trees without damaging roots.<\/p>","first_text_class":"richtext-md h3-margin-bottom","first_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/floating-deck-ideas-for-every-backyard.png","second_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/floating-deck-ideas-for-every-backyard_47325f0e-96e1-4892-99a0-8eae4860552e.png","second_richtext":"<h3><strong>Garden Platform<\/strong><\/h3><p>Elevate your view with a floating deck overlooking your garden beds and landscaping.<\/p><h3><strong>Hot Tub Base<\/strong><\/h3><p>Provide stable, level support for your hot tub with a custom-sized floating deck system.<\/p><h3><strong>Fire Pit Gathering Space<\/strong><\/h3><p>Create a safe, stable platform around your fire pit for chairs and conversation.<\/p><h3><strong>RV or Mobile Home Addition<\/strong><\/h3><p>Easy to install and remove, perfect for temporary homes or seasonal properties.<\/p><h3><strong>Slope Solution<\/strong><\/h3><p>Uneven backyard? A floating deck creates level outdoor space on challenging terrain<\/p>","second_text_class":"richtext-md h3-margin-bottom"}},"content_grid_Kc4fn6":{"type":"content-grid","blocks":{"layout_flex_jnbgQN":{"type":"layout__flex","settings":{"flex_direction_align_x_align_y_gap_wrap":"column | left | center|","padding_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 0 | 0 | 0","border_width_radius":"0 | 0","background_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","border_color":"","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"48\/0 | 48\/36 | 0 | 24\/0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"464px\/100% | unset | 2 | unset | inherit","responsive_visibility":"","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":""}},"richtext_PzNbp4":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"title":"<p><strong>What Our Customers Are Saying<\/strong><\/p>","page_content":"","use_page_content":false,"content_class":"text-54\/40","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 0 | 0 | 0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"100% | unset | 1 | unset | center","responsive_visibility":"","hide_if_empty":"none","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":"","color_override":"rgba(0,0,0,0)"}},"layout_grid_slider_aVnnCz":{"type":"layout__grid_slider","settings":{"slider_cols_rows_align_x_align_y_gap":"1 | 1  | center\/start | start | 80\/24","slider_scroll_snap":"snap-mandatory [&>*]:snap-start","slider_overflow_container":"","infinite_scroll":false,"padding_top_bottom_left_right_box":"0 | 0 | 0 | 0","auto_scroll":0,"scroll_navigation_style":"pagination","scroll_navigation_style_mobile":"inherit","padding_top_bottom_left_right":"32\/24 | 0 | 48\/16 | 48\/16","scrollbar_class":"scrollbar","size_border_width_radius":"12\/8 | 0 | 999px","flex_direction_align_x_align_y_gap_wrap":"row | start\/center| center | 12\/8","background_color":"#d9d4d2","border_color":"","hover_bor